{"version":1,"content":"<html><body><p style=\"text-align: left;\">《美食新聞報道》將帶領觀眾尋覓特色佳餚，由張與辰領軍，帶同蔡景行（行仔）前往灣仔品嚐他極致痴迷的糖水店；而施焯日（Arthur）與陳若思（Amber）則會到銅鑼灣發掘一間將港式料理與意大利菜完美結合的Fusion餐廳。</p><h3 style=\"text-align: left;\"></h3><p style=\"text-align: left;\">自認不太嗜甜的張與辰，對灣仔一間糖水店的出品卻情有獨鍾，不但創下一年光顧超過30次的紀錄，更曾因排隊人龍太長而甘願買外賣在門外站著吃。</p><ul class=\"tiptap-bullet-list\"><li></li><li></li></ul><p style=\"text-align: left;\">C DESSERT</p><p style=\"text-align: left;\">地址：灣仔莊士敦道35-45號利文樓地下1D號舖</p><h3 style=\"text-align: left;\"></h3><div class=\"image-block responsive-block\" data-bs-component=\"generic\" style=\"margin: 0px 0px 4px; border-radius: 8px; overflow: hidden; background: rgb(255, 255, 255); border: 1px solid rgb(228, 231, 237);\">\n<div class=\"image-container\" style=\"position: relative; width: 100%; border-radius: 8px 8px 0px 0px;\">\n<img alt=\"f3d932f4-ea28-4fa6-b573-3db69833d422.png.webp\" src=\"https://pro-img-cdn.tvb.com/uploads/file/2026/09/2026QOnVXs4DYM1788835423.webp?x-oss-process=image/resize,w_1200\" style=\"width: 100%; max-width: 100%; height: auto; border-radius: 8px 8px 0px 0px; display: block; object-fit: contain;\" title=\"f3d932f4-ea28-4fa6-b573-3db69833d422.png.webp\"/>\n</div>\n</div><p style=\"text-align: left;\"></p><div class=\"image-block responsive-block\" data-bs-component=\"generic\" style=\"margin: 0px 0px 4px; border-radius: 8px; overflow: hidden; background: rgb(255, 255, 255); border: 1px solid rgb(228, 231, 237);\">\n<div class=\"image-container\" style=\"position: relative; width: 100%; border-radius: 8px 8px 0px 0px;\">\n<img alt=\"a047450b-91f2-4aba-ac2b-20494fbeab47.png.webp\" src=\"https://pro-img-cdn.tvb.com/uploads/file/2026/09/2026A952BHSSPY1788835423.webp?x-oss-process=image/resize,w_1200\" style=\"width: 100%; max-width: 100%; height: auto; border-radius: 8px 8px 0px 0px; display: block; object-fit: contain;\" title=\"a047450b-91f2-4aba-ac2b-20494fbeab47.png.webp\"/>\n</div>\n</div><p style=\"text-align: left;\"></p><div class=\"image-block responsive-block\" data-bs-component=\"generic\" style=\"margin: 0px 0px 4px; border-radius: 8px; overflow: hidden; background: rgb(255, 255, 255); border: 1px solid rgb(228, 231, 237);\">\n<div class=\"image-container\" style=\"position: relative; width: 100%; border-radius: 8px 8px 0px 0px;\">\n<img alt=\"325add43-9a75-4b12-ae1f-7df01fca2b32.png.webp\" src=\"https://pro-img-cdn.tvb.com/uploads/file/2026/09/2026Zu16ishwGe1788835423.webp?x-oss-process=image/resize,w_1200\" style=\"width: 100%; max-width: 100%; height: auto; border-radius: 8px 8px 0px 0px; display: block; object-fit: contain;\" title=\"325add43-9a75-4b12-ae1f-7df01fca2b32.png.webp\"/>\n</div>\n</div><p style=\"text-align: left;\"></p><p style=\"text-align: left;\">另一邊廂，施焯日（Arthur）與陳若思（Amber）介紹了一間位於銅鑼灣的Fusion餐廳。老闆曾於意大利學藝，回港後刻意將港式料理元素融入傳統意大利菜之中，帶來意想不到的驚喜。</p><ul class=\"tiptap-bullet-list\"><li></li><li></li></ul><p style=\"text-align: left;\">Papamia</p><p style=\"text-align: left;\">地址：銅鑼灣霎東街15號OLIV 24樓</p><p style=\"text-align: left;\"></p><div class=\"image-block responsive-block\" data-bs-component=\"generic\" style=\"margin: 0px 0px 4px; border-radius: 8px; overflow: hidden; background: rgb(255, 255, 255); border: 1px solid rgb(228, 231, 237);\">\n<div class=\"image-container\" style=\"position: relative; width: 100%; border-radius: 8px 8px 0px 0px;\">\n<img alt=\"6320d1cf-538d-4cac-a31a-0de8901dc746.png.webp\" src=\"https://pro-img-cdn.tvb.com/uploads/file/2026/09/2026jPxtMOQCcv1788835424.webp?x-oss-process=image/resize,w_1200\" style=\"width: 100%; max-width: 100%; height: auto; border-radius: 8px 8px 0px 0px; display: block; object-fit: contain;\" title=\"6320d1cf-538d-4cac-a31a-0de8901dc746.png.webp\"/>\n</div>\n</div><p style=\"text-align: left;\"></p><div class=\"image-block responsive-block\" data-bs-component=\"generic\" style=\"margin: 0px 0px 4px; border-radius: 8px; overflow: hidden; background: rgb(255, 255, 255); border: 1px solid rgb(228, 231, 237);\">\n<div class=\"image-container\" style=\"position: relative; width: 100%; border-radius: 8px 8px 0px 0px;\">\n<img alt=\"9e164480-0243-4a9d-a2cf-627d6fcaf4da.png.webp\" src=\"https://pro-img-cdn.tvb.com/uploads/file/2026/09/2026642wUmbPIU1788835424.webp?x-oss-process=image/resize,w_1200\" style=\"width: 100%; max-width: 100%; height: auto; border-radius: 8px 8px 0px 0px; display: block; object-fit: contain;\" title=\"9e164480-0243-4a9d-a2cf-627d6fcaf4da.png.webp\"/>\n</div>\n</div><p style=\"text-align: left;\"></p><div class=\"image-block responsive-block\" data-bs-component=\"generic\" style=\"margin: 0px 0px 4px; border-radius: 8px; overflow: hidden; background: rgb(255, 255, 255); border: 1px solid rgb(228, 231, 237);\">\n<div class=\"image-container\" style=\"position: relative; width: 100%; border-radius: 8px 8px 0px 0px;\">\n<img alt=\"fb1f10d0-106d-4e13-b031-c14700664c8c.png.webp\" src=\"https://pro-img-cdn.tvb.com/uploads/file/2026/09/2026Bk8m74RFbY1788835424.webp?x-oss-process=image/resize,w_1200\" style=\"width: 100%; max-width: 100%; height: auto; border-radius: 8px 8px 0px 0px; display: block; object-fit: contain;\" title=\"fb1f10d0-106d-4e13-b031-c14700664c8c.png.webp\"/>\n</div>\n</div></body></html>","scraped_at":"2026-09-08T14:15:07.044007+00:00","quality":{"score":1,"chars":332,"images":6,"source":"TVB 新聞","fallback":"none"}}